<title>SWITZERLAND: BZ Trust builds 14.5 pct Winterthur stake.</title>
<headline>BZ Trust builds 14.5 pct Winterthur stake.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZ Trust AG said its BK Vision and Stillhalter Vision investment trusts have built up holdings in Winterthur Insurance Co amounting to a combined 14.5 percent.</p>
<p>It said BK Vision's stake in Winterthur's registered shares totalled 7.0 percent and Stillhalter Vision's holding 7.5 percent as of April 30, 1997. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
